# Normalise line endings on commit: LF in the repository, whatever the
# platform checkout uses. Keeps diffs clean across Windows/macOS/Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.ttf binary
*.ttc binary

# Generated figures are not tracked (see .gitignore); the rule is here in case
# a user commits a frozen copy of them on purpose.
Figure*.pdf binary
Figure*.png binary
